<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(Advanced Manual Testing: Overview This module provides foundational knowledge and practical skills in software testing using Manual Techniques. It is designed for beginners aiming to understand Software Testing Principles, Processes, and best practices without relying on Automation Tools. This module will make you proficient in testcase designing, testcase writing, bug raising and bug tracking. Industry experts who have been working on projects will be personally assisting in bringing out the best in you.)/E(Advanced Manual Testing: Overview This module provides foundational knowledge and practical skills in software testing using Manual Techniques. It is designed for beginners aiming to understand Software Testing Principles, Processes, and best practices without relying on Automation Tools. This module will make you proficient in testcase designing, testcase writing, bug raising and bug tracking. Industry experts who have been working on projects will be personally assisting in bringing out the best in you.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[53]>>
